<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/2/eng@/~cl_11__para_c__subpara_iv> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsections: “(4) No person shall carry out the duties or functions of a chief executive under this Act where— (a) he is not registered as a chief executive; or (b) his registration as a chief executive has been cancelled under subsection (3) or paragraph 37(1)(bb). (5) Any person who contravenes the provisions of subsection (4) shall be guilty of an offence.”. New section 33a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/2/eng@> .
