<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/2/eng@/~cl_14> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 38 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) No course of study or training programme shall be conducted by the private higher educational institution unless the private higher educational institution has been registered under section 24.”. Amendment of section 40"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/2/eng@> .
